{"baseRefName":"main","baseRefOid":"f408039dc3a9b0d2e0e8d246c126af892839cee8","body":"Creating or changing a regular file at the repository's `state` path previously escaped the test-state guard. The approved ITEM5-B-KIT-REVIEW-01 payload hashes that root file and adds nested-pytest coverage for new, modified and unchanged baselines. The shared upgrade wording now describes rendered-text comparison after newline normalization; the release manifest carries the approved hashes.\n\nThe operator approved the exact kit-only packet on 2026-09-10 and requested autonomous continuation. The applied scope is the requested guard, regressions, wording, manifest, supplied changelog template and scoped records. No new traversal or recovery mechanism is added. The changelog PR number will be substituted from this PR's returned identity before final review.\n\n`make test`, run in `/Users/topi/Coding/agentic-dev-kit` at `1f6195d64482bef4a5437c1eff3a07069e2b14b8` on 2026-09-10, printed `1 failed, 2503 passed, 1 skipped in 389.80s (0:06:29)`. Its failure is the disclosed #393 deep-JSON hook case. The manifest self-check passed without deselecting driftcheck, regeneration matched the approved bytes, and separate shell parses covered #561's named omissions. Exact command logs and retention evidence will accompany the scoped execution record. Hosted CI and a fresh independent adversarial/correctness panel are required at the final head.\n\nMerge class: **operator-merge**. Hold the exact reviewed head for the operator; this execution approval does not authorize merge. Retained fixture/source writes, baseline refresh, initialization, client/trust/profile changes, tracker payloads and fixture PR closure/merge remain excluded. Phase 5 item 5 remains incomplete; item 6's completed replay is preserved.\n","headRefName":"chore/item5-b-review-repair-20260910","headRefOid":"1f6195d64482bef4a5437c1eff3a07069e2b14b8","isDraft":false,"mergeCommit":null,"number":731,"state":"OPEN","title":"Detect regular files at the test state root","url":"https://github.com/topij/agentic-dev-kit/pull/731"}
